2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2387) '- GitHub Actions builds every double binary that a rung runs or ships. A build on a desk from a dev branch is not covered (operator, 2026-11-03).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2387  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2387) '- Releases go on entities-zone (operator, 2026-11-03). The workflow lives on the engine branch `dev/double-release` of &{repo("entities-godot")}, and entities-assembly merges it into `r0-base`, so every release carries it. The workflow changes only through that branch and the assembler (operator, 2026-11-03).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2387  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2387) '- The engine fork keeps upstream's nine workflows off and pays no runner minutes for them.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2387  1 LINE
 Text:Written

